            meaning: "Energy is never closed: it is spent once and radiated as heat. What matters is whether the ship carries a thousand years of fuel and can shed its heat. Fission is operating technology; 74 to 90 million t of heavy metal fissioned over the voyage, and 107,000 km2 of radiators at room temperature.",
